      "entry": "Team Deathmatch/ExperimentalArea",
      "beforePresent": true,
      "afterPresent": true,
      "before": "Experimental bounded arena. Full-map preserves normal TDM settings. Factory South requires Factory daytime and fixes the match at 2v2. Customs Factory Center enables the Customs map for independent TDM at 2v2; full-map Customs is unavailable. Factory Center (contour) uses the surveyed outline with side walls only and no height restriction. Also selectable in the native Arena map menu, which adapts this value to the chosen map/mode. Selected before loading; changes during a raid apply next match. Other modes ignore this setting. The area must pass its live navigation checks.",
      "after": "Experimental bounded arena. Full-map preserves normal TDM settings. Factory South requires Factory daytime and fixes the match at 2v2. Customs Factory Center enables the Customs map for independent TDM at 2v2; full-map Customs is unavailable. Factory Center (contour) and Factory East (contour) use surveyed outlines with side walls only and no height restriction; both fix teams at 2v2. Also selectable in the native Arena map menu, which adapts this value to the chosen map/mode. Selected before loading; changes during a raid apply next match. Other modes ignore this setting. The area must pass its live navigation checks."
